        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{6(2-3x)}{x(2-3x)}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}12-18x&=6(2-3x)\\\\2x-3x^2&=x(2-3x)\\\\\\frac{12-18x}{2x-3x^2}&=\\frac{6(2-3x)}{x(2-3x)}\\end{align*}$$",
